From 7fbfc2d9b9171be7ac2612922866e77d86f2f6e4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: benrichard-amd <ben.richard@amd.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 20:43:48 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(packaging): remove hardcoded x86_64 BuildArch from RPM
 packaging

package.json hardcodes BuildArch: x86_64 in all entries, which causes
rpmbuild to fail on non-x86 hosts. Remove the field and fall back to
platform.machine() in rpm_package.py.

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
